  "prefLabel": "Mec 407.01 Types of Reinstatement of Mechanical Licenses for Business Entities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 407.01 Types of Reinstatement of Mechanical Licenses for Business Entities. The board shall reinstate mechanical licenses for business entities:\n\n(a) In accordance with the terms of the board's order if the licenses were suspended for disciplinary reasons; or\n\n(b) In accordance with Mec 407.02 if the licenses lapsed as a result of non-renewal.\n\nSource. #10848, eff 7-1-15; ss by #13771, eff 12-10-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 407.01) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 400)",
